      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "PostgreSQL owns durable domain truth. Temporal owns in-flight execution history. The append-only ledger owns consequential proof. Read models, chat history, model memory, webpages, and provider delivery states own none of these.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PostgreSQL owns durable domain truth. Temporal owns in-flight execution history. The append-only ledger owns consequential proof. Read models, chat history, model memory, webpages, and provider delivery states own none of these.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
