      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Open choices: managed identity / PostgreSQL host, model routes, managed browser provider, token-broker buy vs build, Photon production readiness, and observability vendor. The owned contracts and safety invariants remain stable across those choices.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
